  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Implementation of the Reference Regional Strategic Framework for Statistical Capacity Building in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to operationalize the Reference Regional Strategic Framework for Statistical Capacity Building in Africa (RRSF) with a view to integrating selected RRSF actions in the NSDS process in Africa. Main focus will be on mainstreaming gender statistics in the development processcomma promoting regional integration and statistical harmonizationcomma and developing human resources through training.</narrative>
  </description>
